---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="About Us — UK Calculator" 
  description="Learn about UK Calculator, our mission to provide free, accurate, and localized financial, tax, property, and personal calculators for England, Scotland, Wales, and Northern Ireland."
>
  <div class="crumb" style="padding: 16px 48px 0; font-size: 13px; color: #64748b;">
    <a href="/" style="color: #64748b; text-decoration: none;">Home</a>
    <span style="margin: 0 6px;">›</span>
    <span style="color: #0f172a; font-weight: 600;">About Us</span>
  </div>

  <div style="max-width: 900px; margin: 32px auto 80px; padding: 0 24px;">
    <div style="background: #ffffff; border: 1.5px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 20px; padding: 48px; box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04);">
      <h1 style="font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px;">About UK Calculator</h1>
      
      <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; color: #334155; margin-bottom: 24px;">
        <strong>UK Calculator</strong> is an independent, non-partisan platform created to provide simple, accurate, and completely free financial, tax, employment, and everyday tools tailored specifically to the United Kingdom.
      </p>

      <h2 style="font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a; margin-top: 36px; margin-bottom: 12px;">Our Mission</h2>
      <p style="font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: #334155; margin-bottom: 20px;">
        Navigating UK tax codes, NI thresholds, property duties, and devolved regional laws can be confusing. Our goal is to make personal finance and statutory calculations straightforward for everyone — whether you are an employee checking your take-home pay, a small business owner calculating VAT, or a home buyer estimating Stamp Duty.
      </p>

      <h2 style="font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a; margin-top: 36px; margin-bottom: 12px;">Localized for Devolved Nations</h2>
      <p style="font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: #334155; margin-bottom: 20px;">
        Unlike generic calculators, UK Calculator automatically accounts for regional differences across:
      </p>
      <ul style="font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.8; color: #334155; padding-left: 24px; margin-bottom: 24px;">
        <li><strong>England</strong>: Standard HMRC tax bands, SDLT, and council tax rules.</li>
        <li><strong>Scotland</strong>: Scottish Income Tax bands (Starter, Basic, Intermediate, Higher, Advanced, Top) and Land & Buildings Transaction Tax (LBTT).</li>
        <li><strong>Wales</strong>: Welsh Rate of Income Tax (WRIT) and Land Transaction Tax (LTT).</li>
        <li><strong>Northern Ireland</strong>: NI rates and domestic rating rules.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 style="font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a; margin-top: 36px; margin-bottom: 12px;">Privacy & Transparency</h2>
      <p style="font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: #334155; margin-bottom: 0;">
        All calculations happen directly in your browser. We never store or transmit your salary, financial inputs, or personal information. Our tools are 100% free to use with no registration required.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
